    "created_at": "2024-09-03T09:21:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-09-03T09:21:08Z",
    "body": "Demo: https://meta-viewport-changes.glitch.me/\r\n\r\nIt seems Firefox responds to changes to the `content` attribute (e.g. change to `initial-scale=0.5`) and inserting the element, but not removing the element (testing with devtools). Same in Chrome (devtools) and Safari (on iPad).\r\n\r\nSince there seems to be interop in ignoring removing the element, I think that's what should be standardized.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
